WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:02.669
Now a tailor unzips a garment bag

2
00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:04.713
and shows Salander a black leather jacket.

3
00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:08.425
She compares it to Blomkvist’s jacket
in the photo of him and Erika.

4
00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:18.310
As he zips the bag back up,
Salander gives a wistful look.

5
00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:22.606
Now at her apartment,
she intently writes a message inside a card,

6
00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:24.358
then slides it into an envelope.

7
00:00:25.901 --> 00:00:31.198
The card's cover shows a horse bending its neck down
as a child bundled against the cold pats its head.

8
00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:34.034
Salander writes an ‘M’ on the front of the envelope,

9
00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.035
then underlines it.

10
00:00:35.202 --> 00:00:36.203
She stares off.

11
00:00:37.079 --> 00:00:37.746
Night-time.

12
00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:45.212
Snow drifts to the ground
as Salander glides her motorcycle down a hill

13
00:00:45.212 --> 00:00:48.215
and parks across the street
from Blomkvist’s apartment building.

14
00:00:48.674 --> 00:00:50.634
Dismounting, she removes her helmet,

15
00:00:50.843 --> 00:00:54.513
then takes the garment bag with her gift
off the bike's rear cargo rack.

16
00:00:58.559 --> 00:01:01.228
She sees Blomkvist and Erika leaving the building

17
00:01:01.228 --> 00:01:04.898
and watches unnoticed as he drapes
an arm over her shoulders.

18
00:01:06.441 --> 00:01:10.112
The couple heads down a walkway
to a waiting taxi at the top of a hill.

19
00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:19.121
Salander watches woundedly
as they climb into the cab,

20
00:01:19.121 --> 00:01:21.039
then lowers her heartbroken gaze.

21
00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:27.713
Turning away, she tosses Blomkvist’s gift
into a dumpster against the side of a building.

22
00:01:28.046 --> 00:01:30.257
She glances at the cab as it drives off,

23
00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:31.675
then dons her helmet

24
00:01:31.675 --> 00:01:32.634
and mounts her bike.

25
00:01:37.389 --> 00:01:42.561
She speeds off down the cobblestone street,
her figure disappearing from view as she rounds a corner.